 keycard sandbox   setup · step 1 of 5

  Keycard account
  Setup signs in to Keycard with your organization's service account. It uses
  the account only to set up the sandbox.

  Service account client secret
  ╭──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
  │                                                                          │
  ╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
  Hidden as you type. It stays in memory until you quit. Set
  KEYCARD_CLIENT_SECRET to skip this question.









  enter  continue   esc  stop setup
